  "text": "Everything you write in Memree note lives in a vault. A vault is just a folder of Markdown files on your computer, so your notes stay yours, and any other app can read them. The first time you open Memree note, you pick a name and a place for it. The name sits up here, and this list shows every vault you have. Open vault lets you point Memree note at a folder you already keep.",
